{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"BODY","start":659,"end":701,"target_id":"347b8be3285ab9fa438be909bdf940f7cf613d6ee23e9cf6eabe995c7af5d134","source_hash":"1ae053cd4facb52e82d9c02e2add836e3681fae24fdf9096a92449b89f7cd755","text":"补充规定 <2006年8月14日第68号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"BODY","start":701,"end":742,"target_id":"c83488d5c47262156cbea03569d85e212bddf9733cbd079f79d06894bc3fe5eb","source_hash":"378c099c8259e3ca325c93a2ac77ea1eb2d32724a739a011ae42921644f383a4","text":"补充规定（外交部及其下属机构组织结构实施细则）<2013年3月23日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"BODY","start":742,"end":788,"target_id":"3ddcbc824039af4c90308464d11c03f0d728993a87fd4b874147c0d479b602df","source_hash":"ce3145e93bda203ec3e87e7bc25e691f9b574a33d33d742afdfdccffb408a741","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"BODY","start":788,"end":2409,"target_id":"31a930aee3534357dd3ce48750965e7ba2e045e0873a9104468158c9ede8253a","source_hash":"d54539b7389cd5349f9b9ad57b4ccc881c171bf8db60c7b1a4587bb71f40cd07","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至⑫ 省略\n\n  13. 对驻外使团武官对外称号的规定作如下部分修改。\n\n  第三条第一款中的“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  ⑭ 至 <18> 已省略\n\n驻外使团财务专员外部职称表 [与第3条相关]\n[附录] <修订于1995年4月19日，2006年8月14日>                                      \n\n  驻外使团财务专员外部职称列表（与第3条相关）                                 \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃대외직명                │대외직명                                    ┃\n\n┃직위                    ├───────┬──────────────┨\n\n┃                        │국문          │영문                        ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃육, 해, 공군을 대표하고 │국방무관      │Defense Attache             ┃\n\n┃있는 무관중 당해 공관에 │              │                            ┃\n\n┃서 최상위계급에 있는 자 │              │                            ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃위 외의 자              │국방무관보좌관│Assistant Defense Attache   ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃각군을 대표하고 있는 무 │육군무관      │Army Attache                ┃\n\n┃관중 당해 공관에서 최상 │해군무관      │Naval Attache               ┃\n\n┃위계급에 있는 자        │공군무관      │Air Force Attache           ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃위 외의 자              │육군무관보좌관│Assistant Army Attache      ┃\n\n┃                        │해군무관보좌관│Assistant Naval Attache     ┃\n\n┃                        │공군무관보좌관│Assistant Air Force Attache ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃국방연구개발에 관한 업무│국방과학연구  │Defense Research and        ┃\n\n┃를 담당하는 자          │개발무관      │Development Attache         ┃\n\n┠────────────┼───────┼──────────────┨\n\n┃군수에 관한 업무를 담당 │국방군수무관  │Defense Logistics Attache   ┃\n\n┃하는 자                 │              │                            ┃\n\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛"},{"id":"A34257-zh-00001","doc":"A34257","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2492500","source_hash":"fe925704366b35e609fda62e83171d15e5a9ee7e947589520c50aa02b4e938fd","text":"[附录] <修订于1995年4月19日，2006年8月14日>"},{"id":"A34257-zh-00002","doc":"A34257","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2492501","source_hash":"506f7a4cbe21b2641285db608bba5efe8d92533959d8000cb78923d3dc97724c","text":"驻外使团财务专员外部职称列表（与第3条相关）"},{"id":"A34257-zh-00003","doc":"A34257","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2492502","source_hash":"ca57774783cacca46360be6a854c59d09ddf8dc160e088c472df619258106cc9","text":"外部职位名称"},{"id":"A34257-zh-00004","doc":"A34257","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2492503","source_hash":"ca57774783cacca46360be6a854c59d09ddf8dc160e088c472df619258106cc9","text":"外部职位名称"},{"id":"A34257-zh-00005","doc":"A34257","law_id":"kr-008003-138058-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2492504","source_hash":"a671c8c8aa32